    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d539">

                <pb facs="0540" n="368" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg368"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/939</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Morgan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-14T17:00:00-03:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 14, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 6.20 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Understand that Argentina desires to turn proposed congress of neutrals into
                    congress of Latin America and that Brazil and Uruguay have, gone so far as to
                    inquire what program may be.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
